Package: libnetfilter-cttimeout1
Version: 1.0.0-r0
Description: Netfilter connection tracking timeout library
 Userspace library providing a programming interface (API) to the Linux
 kernel netfilter fine-grain connection tracking timeout infrastructure
Section: base
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: GPLv2+
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: libnetfilter-cttimeout
Depends: libmnl0 (>= 1.0.3), libc6 (>= 2.21)
Provides: libnetfilter-cttimeout
Source: http://www.netfilter.org/projects/libnetfilter_cttimeout/files/libnetfilter_cttimeout-1.0.0.tar.bz2;name=tar
